    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5f4fc36f981314fc7b1d8fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小说家兴奋异常……但几天后，\n他通知我们，因为无法完美表现那种力道，\n他放弃写这部小说了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db1cea80679dc3c1d3a87881178116b6295536d0ba1ce36d97a9ea87ba79cbc",
