      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对哦……好，我要紧黏着她不放！\n就是要死缠烂打地采访才能写出名作！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c8ad0b090b943e531dbdb254741cc35010bf37cd1e85180530ee69d78cb9b1f",
