      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啧……烦死人了。\n我要照原定计划去绕着学园跑耐力跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51f67f85c750acea1d66a76058fa1cd60bce2fb1f22138a2fb59ec7427dbfd04",
